<!--/VOLSTEP--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-c301e2afd5fe84a5"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-25bd438ba3c856eb"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>极冰点换挡：温度 28.9→<b class="down">11.0</b>（250 日极低分位）、涨停 71→<b class="down">39</b>（-45.1%）、跌停 5→<b class="down">41</b>、封板额 45.62→<b class="down">31.1 亿</b>（-31.7%）、一进二率 17.2%→<b class="down">9.5%</b>、最高板 5→4 双峰（001219 一字 / 002708 假一字） · stage=<em>退潮</em>・direction=<em>降</em>・攻防<em>防守·总仓≤2.5%</em> · 五路周期投票＝降 3 / 平 2 / 升 0（无复议）</h3></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-ce6a183f7add3aa5"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能台阶 → 情绪先行指标 → 五态与五路周期投票 → 连板梯队 → 攻防档位 → 自主深挖 → 我的认知迭代。周期路只做环境判定：不荐个股、不写交易计划、不给买卖点；个股与执行口径以五路判断页与总审为准。<b>本页一句话</b>：今天不是&quot;涨停少了 32 只&quot;那么简单，而是<b>宽度、封单、接力三条腿同时收缩</b>——涨停 71→39、封板额 -31.7%、一进二率腰斩到 9.5%；但同时<b>核按钮率 0.0%</b>（昨日 71 只涨停今日无一回杀）、<b>41 家中 38 家是当日首次跌停</b>。前者说&quot;赚钱效应塌了&quot;，后者说&quot;这是外力砸出来的跌停潮、不是链条内部崩塌&quot;，两条腿方向相反，本页按两腿分列判读，不取平均。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-af731c1b73283254"></span><span id="claim-cycle-a86c997c72669796"></span><span id="claim-cycle-5c6759cb31fcb0a9"></span><span id="claim-cycle-af414f84ae5a0ddb"></span><span id="claim-cycle-3d47ab91616ba57e"></span><span id="claim-cycle-b7509df0a65eb4c5"></span><span id="claim-cycle-37b1ec8a03c861cf"></span><span id="claim-cycle-983e7ca0f6f99f19"></span><span id="claim-cycle-5d59d5bdca9a46e1"></span><span id="claim-cycle-ebea9e6acdd33975"></span><span id="claim-cycle-0539c79538ce62ae"></span><span id="claim-cycle-336384fbe2e4fb6d"></span><span id="claim-cycle-d7626571de588140"></span><span id="claim-cycle-cb1ce9192fcae0dc"></span><span id="claim-cycle-5de4b492a5cd43cd"></span><span id="claim-cycle-4083e69595922c6b"></span><span id="claim-cycle-59bce4bd12fa2246"></span><span id="claim-cycle-1971bdc8f7bf6f40"></span><span id="cla